Continual learning is about to get boring, in a good way.

@willcb from @primeintellect took the stage at our recent Learning Loop event to make the case.

If you're thinking about how continual learning fits into the way your team already ships software, this full 21-minute session is a good place to start.

“Typically the manual mechanism takes about 20 days. Just with the first pass, we are able to drive it down to 10.”

